{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大字号白字，视线容易被红色强调词“不再藏着喜欢”“我不再为它道歉”吸引，随后落到下方黄色强调词“连害臊都顾不上了”“没什么不好”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始不再掩饰自己对对方的喜欢；但是否意识到双方彼此需要，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"开心、坦然、不再为自己的喜欢感到羞愧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想到自己需要对方、对方有时也需要自己，即使对方不需要自己也愿意陪伴；以及欢喜背后，对方未来是否还愿意让他陪伴的不确定和心痛。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方红色强调段、黄色强调段、下方灰白色段都具有较强视觉权重。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思，尤其第一块需要读完整句才能知道他具体想到了什么。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里、要拼起来才懂：喜欢与坦然在前两块，未来的不确定和欢喜中的心痛在最下面一块。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8fd1680b-5fcb-4a9f-af12-5e8b1b9a0882", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012131121795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:21:58.833662+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4bc9e909047d995293da522320412d2452c94844a170279951371d4e2fcfa297", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1